		(uuid "6ac602e5-99a1-55f7-9d34-a735c57cd709")
	)
	(text "Populated capacitances follow Allwinner STD / hardware guide p39.\nKeep the individual capacitors at the corresponding ball clusters; bulk PMIC output capacitors are additional.\nUse X5R/X7R parts with adequate effective capacitance at the operating voltage.\nFeedback routing: M19 CPUB, V16 CPUL, L15 SYS, W10 DNR."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
